----------------------------------------------------
 Aggregate
   ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on bark_bmap
         Recheck Cond: ((a = 10) OR (b = 5))
         ->  BitmapOr
               ->  Bitmap Index Scan on bark_bmap_a
                     Index Cond: (a = 10)
               ->  Bitmap Index Scan on bark_bmap_b
                     Index Cond: (b = 5)
(8 rows)

